{"server":"cn","storyId":"act49side_level_act49side_st01","groupId":"act49side","stageId":"act49side_st01","title":"蒙不失诵","storyCode":"TA-ST-1","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act49side/level_act49side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"0ad10371f90e3add5d49282fe1abdbf73df09fda7de33ad32e6dbc377887ba87","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"百珍宴后，炎国各地异象迭生。真龙与太尉约定，以望日为限，起兵伐岁。左乐离开界园，携信物赶回百灶。与此同时，陈步入巨兽编织的梦。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"cg_moonmasked"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>？？？</>\n“......域外方士有言，北境有大山，名璟。山中有奇石，名娲。\n\n“其方见千丈，高见千丈。形似珠玉，色若琉璃......\n\n“其光昭昭，其焰煌煌，万年不竭......”\n“可摧金石，可生万物，其道不可知，其理不可察......\n\n\n“若得此神物，或可助大炎渡此劫难。”"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_5"},{"type":"narration","text":"“先生，我不明白，我辈为寻此物牺牲惨重，您却准备将其拱手送与炎家？”\n“那人擅启战端，致使万千生灵涂炭，您又为何要助此失德之君？”"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_4"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我辈志在解生民之难，非为助一君......天数有时，也不在一人......”\n“只求当下战乱早日停息，百姓不必再受战乱之苦......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......是了，是了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这便是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......大炎的“天数”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1102年 深秋</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，还在值班呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"执勤的近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐——不是，熊sir......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"执勤的近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是前阵子中秋节，下城区有市民看花灯看上了车道，我们巡逻的人手不够，没拦住人，结果差点出事故。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"执勤的近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"为这事，局长可是发了好一通火......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿呦，那是不太应该。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"执勤的近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我们全队都吃处罚，这个月的执勤时间都得加倍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"执勤的近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"她还说最近魏总督不在，我们都得格外小心点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，多小心点总没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家伙都辛苦了，正好带了点吃的，大伙分分吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"执勤的近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"熊sir，这多不好意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别犟，肚子叫得跟打雷似的，吃点吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"执勤的近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"欸我不是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"执勤的近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"好端端的，哪来的雷啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"执勤的近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我是眼花了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"执勤的近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"那边的天上......是什么东西？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g09_teahouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1629_1","isRemote":false,"text":"师傅，先不忙着上船，你看那边，好像有什么东西在江上动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1629_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是循兽？可循兽怎么会在江上，背上还驮着什么......酒盏？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蜃景罢了，你们勾吴城外说不定也有。有什么好看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......破。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1629_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，怎么突然下雨了......江上的循兽呢？跑哪去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今年这场秋雨......怕是要冻煞人啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎国士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_2136_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报！报——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎国士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_2136_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨兽......巨兽抵达最后警戒位置！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎国士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_2136_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最高级警备！重复一遍，全军立即进入最高级警备！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎国士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_2136_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*炎国粗口*......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎国士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_2136_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那东西根本不像是什么“兽”，那明明就是一座山......一整座山......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"府中杂役","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大人，您留步吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"府中杂役","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太尉大人重病在床，什么人都不可见的，您——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"府中杂役","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太尉在府中吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"府中杂役","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在......在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......带路吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"cg_eave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......刚才恍惚梦中，仿佛见到故人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为......是先帝，要来带我走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道太尉时常追思先帝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但此刻就惦记身后事，怕是太心急了一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陛下......光临......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恕臣......不能起身行礼了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......几日不见，太尉怎么病成了这副样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吃过药了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"劳陛下体恤......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我这痨病本就是陈年顽疾......前阵子中秋气候反常，又染上了风寒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"朽木之躯，怕是熬不过这个冬天了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......太尉是大炎股肱之臣，不可妄自菲薄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太尉曾经将多少外敌强虏挡在大炎国门之外，又怎么会畏惧这小小风寒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安心休养，我还等着太尉早日康复，为我分忧，为大炎解难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......老臣年迈昏聩，实在是......不堪所用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如今大炎，人才济济。大小事务，也都由陛下圣断，又何须老臣置喙......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我听明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太尉大人是不满我独断专行，这才要告病还家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老臣......万万不敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近半个月来，来自各地官府，还有各部官员，请战的文书跨过内阁堆满了我的桌子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各个言辞激烈，几近死谏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太尉在这个时候称病，到底是要逼我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......陛下的确是看见了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如今大炎上下，对这桩千年的难题，到底是何态度......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陛下就算不信老臣......也该相信......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......“人心所向”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要能避免让大炎将士轻易流血赴死，任何其他解决之道，我都愿意尝试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以为，太尉最应该体谅我的心思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陛下熟读炎国千卷青史......咳咳——难道不曾见......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"古往今来，那些该流的血......哪一次是避......能避得过的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当断则断。若是一味求全，优柔姑息......要流的血，只多不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我本以为......这是陛下早就明白的道理......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那罪人进入岁陵已半月有余，依然不知吉凶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如今大炎四方扰攘，不止是那五只巨兽雄踞，更有外敌环伺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放他在岁陵里多待一日，大炎的危险就多上十分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这些不是我一人之见......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕我能为陛下压制众意一时......也绝不是长久之法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你想要如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不能要求陛下收回圣命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只恳请陛下......定下一个时日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......大炎可以等待的最后时日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底是不是该流的血，千百年后，史官、百姓，自有公论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在当下，只怕太尉说了不算——我也说了不算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那等不住的，到底是大炎，还是有些人的争功之心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......陛下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是太尉所言，不无道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得，那人是八月既望进的岁陵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就等到下一个望日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那人在岁陵中依然得不出一个结果，那就依太尉的主意行事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陛下......圣明......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那便如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......太尉大人，风寒不是大病，但也要小心休养。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说丹燕的雪梨润肺最好，我一会儿让人送来几枚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今日吃罢雪梨，睡上一觉，太尉这病也就该好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴影中的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明日早朝，莫要迟了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini04_mountaintop"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>望日前三日</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......总算是出来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些巨兽代理人的能耐......当真神奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镇抚仪式，现在才算结束了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，这到底是第几次......我们结束镇抚仪式了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在界园里待了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从天师府终端显示的时间来看，现在离我们进入界园，应该过去了......半月有余？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半月有余？可我怎么觉得，我们好像在里面过了很长一段时间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这段时间里，也不知岁陵那边是否有别的动向......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左兄刚才说，“第几次”......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我总有一种感觉，我们已经不是第一次站在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结束镇抚仪式，收下玉尺，离开界园，回到小镇......这样的事好像发生了很多次，又好像......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有时是易先生迎接我们，有时是那个棋手阻拦了我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有时是后兽化蝶，重创岁兽......也有在半路就中了伥的圈套，莫名其妙被赶出园子的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直有这种感觉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，之前只是隐隐觉得不对劲，直到刚才，我忽然才有了一种在界园里反反复复进出了许多次的感觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若是这样，也许直到现在，镇抚仪式才算是真正结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但愿如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，信物在谁手里？好像每次镇抚仪式结束的时候，易先生的玉尺都交给了不一样的人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不在我这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那难道——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个小物件从左乐的口袋中掉落。\n出乎所有人的预料，那并非是一把玉尺，却是一个小巧的“玩偶”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姨、云兄，我们拿到过这东西吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哟，都活着出来了，能耐不小嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖师！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖......祖师。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你小子，又不是天师府的门生，攀哪门子亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，那晚辈该称呼您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么称呼不称呼，你轻功好，脚程快，赶紧去做你该做的事儿去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该做的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"秉烛人从园子里得了信物，然后该干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回司岁台，交付玉尺，述职。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就快去，还磨蹭什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可玉尺——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信物就是信物，不一样肯定有不一样的道理，你直接回司岁台去就是了。难道你还怕那个代理人报失窃不成？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前辈，我还想问，如今百灶城中——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"磨磨唧唧的，到底你是秉烛人还是我是秉烛人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城里到底是什么样，你自己用眼睛看不就知道了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多大的人了，见机行事的道理还不明白吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我陪左乐同去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖师......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百灶城里现在又用不着人来判冤决狱，你回去也是白搭。你留在这儿，用处还更大些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姓云的小子也一样，你们都不算司岁台的人，留下，免得添乱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三人对视片刻，只得默然听令。\n左乐将信物收入怀中，告别众人，纵跃而去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老......前辈，我还有一事想问......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在进入岁陵前，您带走的那位自称是山海众的姑娘，现在何处？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？看不出来你呆头呆脑，居然也会惦记着人家小姑娘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下只是记得，她曾经说过，界园中存在一件可以阻止炎国与岁兽之间发生战争的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而您之前特别允许我们进入界园，刚才却完全没有打算检查左乐手中的信物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是意味着......您完全相信，她说的话是对的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真有意思......你这些心眼子，怎么也不像是跟着那个练武的学出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下当然相信您的安排自有道理，我只是有些担心，如果真的是如此重要的物件，左乐是否会遇到危险......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，危险不危险的......事到如今，也没谁能置身事外了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是那小子真的有当秉烛人的觉悟，这种时候也该站出来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁","speakerId":"avg_npc_1870_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"易","speakerId":"avg_npc_1869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？少见你这么闷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁","speakerId":"avg_npc_1870_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在忧心，那件信物，他们能顺利送到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁","speakerId":"avg_npc_1870_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道信物究竟是何物的人只能袖手旁观，可以帮我们的人却连该将信物往哪送都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"易","speakerId":"avg_npc_1869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位老天师能做到这份上，已经是对我们天大的照顾。剩下的事，只能看我们一家人的造化了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁","speakerId":"avg_npc_1870_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到最后竟是牵扯了这几位年轻人进来，也不知该说是庆幸，还是让人担忧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"易","speakerId":"avg_npc_1869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一百多年来，也有不少人走入过这座园子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"易","speakerId":"avg_npc_1869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而只有他们将那一点生机，从我们遗落的记忆里摘取下来，护送到了这世上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"易","speakerId":"avg_npc_1869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何也该相信，他们与我们这一家人，多少有些缘分吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁","speakerId":"avg_npc_1870_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生所言在理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"易","speakerId":"avg_npc_1869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，世上风物万千，与人相遇，还是要讲究一个缘分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"易","speakerId":"avg_npc_1869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早早买好了票，做了攻略，背了地图，站在正门等着开园，结果打雷下雨，什么都没看到，也是有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"易","speakerId":"avg_npc_1869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随便从哪个角门进了园子，一路游游逛逛，只要心向一处，结果就能歪打正着，也是有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"易","speakerId":"avg_npc_1869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兴起而来，兴尽而返......强求始终，反倒不雅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"易","speakerId":"avg_npc_1869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们就安心在这里等着，守好这座园子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"易","speakerId":"avg_npc_1869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这良辰美景，还真是没法让人轻易放下呀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>？？？</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......麻烦麻烦，同样的道理讲了一遍又一遍，说得我口干舌燥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这不是又回到了最初的起点？我们辩了几千年的时间，兄台的木头脑袋似乎还是绕不过这个弯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你才是冲天角一根筋，胡搅蛮缠的功夫比做学问的能耐大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最简单的道理——没有规矩，不成方圆。人活于世，当然要辨是非分善恶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真要像你说的，所有人都齐万物，倒黑白，这世上得乱成什么样子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"荒矣谬矣......你坚持的循规蹈矩，不过也是画地为牢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我且问你，要造一房一屋，一城一池，姑且有规矩可循。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可若要丈量千古功过，万民民心——又该以何为规，以何为矩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"规矩，当然是合时而立，为人而立。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我又几时说过，要为了立规矩而立规矩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是......在哪......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你们是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g07_fairyland_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着朴素的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好......那我反倒要请教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着朴素的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说规矩非立不可，那该让谁来当这个立规矩的人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"样貌奇特的工匠","speakerId":"avg_4221_ju_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是由有德之人——有德方能服众，人人信服的规矩才是规矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着朴素的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你瞧，这问题不就来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着朴素的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要定规矩，就要先找有德之人，可什么样的人才算有德？为了找这样的有德之人，是不是又得定一套规矩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着朴素的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"矩兄，枉你活了这万年寿数，却连这先有羽兽还是先有蛋的问题都搞不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"样貌奇特的工匠","speakerId":"avg_4221_ju_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵！简直是无理取闹，强词夺理，倒果为因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"样貌奇特的工匠","speakerId":"avg_4221_ju_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这世上本就有名为“公义”的规矩，又岂是人凭空捏造的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们在说什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着朴素的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，看上去，这位也快要醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着朴素的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醒否？梦否？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"样貌奇特的工匠","speakerId":"avg_4221_ju_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必问了，看她这般浑浑噩噩，庸庸碌碌，的确如在梦中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着朴素的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如梦似醒，非梦非醒。我瞧这位姑娘，现在撞上了难题，可是头疼得很呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"样貌奇特的工匠","speakerId":"avg_4221_ju_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冥顽不灵，不明事理，那自然遇上什么问题都要头疼，走什么路都要撞墙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着朴素的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这倒是没说错......这姑娘知行不一，自无为却求有为，确实是自相矛盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"样貌奇特的工匠","speakerId":"avg_4221_ju_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今，她指望找到一个有体有形的“公正”，还恨不得将“公正”就这样揣进口袋装走。我瞧她比我那不成器的徒弟还要痴上几分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"样貌奇特的工匠","speakerId":"avg_4221_ju_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是了，如果不是世上头一号痴人，又怎会做这般痴心妄想之梦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着朴素的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"矩兄也不必苛责，这世上多的是人缘木求鳞，敲冰求火。又能奈他们何呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着朴素的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有一点你说得没错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着朴素的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位姑娘，到底是个痴人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谁——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g4_tjdiscussionroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_2128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚才，什么都没听到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_2128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这人好奇怪，从刚才开始就一直魂不守舍的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_2128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难不成是被那些伥怪打坏了脑子？——那我也没辙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢你，我还不至于——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是觉得......自己好像......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是第一次来到这里......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["执勤的近卫局成员"]}]}
